      "label": "children dressed in black robes",
      "description": "A group of children, likely boys, are dressed in black hooded robes resembling religious or penitential attire. They are walking in a line on a rocky, dirt path, each carrying a large wooden cross on their shoulders. The children appear solemn and are the central visual focus of the image, evoking imagery of religious penitence or forced indoctrination.",
