      "instance_name": "forced_religious_indoctrination",
      "label": "children carrying crosses in religious garb",
      "description": "A scene depicting children dressed in black robes carrying large wooden crosses on a rocky path, evoking imagery of religious penitence or forced indoctrination. The visual composition suggests a procession or march, with children positioned in a line and moving forward. The scene is framed to emphasize the children as the central focus, with the background showing a natural, outdoor setting. The overlaid text reinforces the interpretation of the scene as a metaphor for forced religious upbringing.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_83bfe865"
